0,Yopno language - Wikipedia,https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Yopno_language,"Yopno language ... Yopno (Yupna, after the Yupna Valley) is one of the Finisterre languages of Papua New Guinea. Dialects are Kewieng, Nokopo, Wandabong, Isan. Yupno speakers orient themselves using local topography. [2]",Yopno,Trans-New Guinea
